  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PALVISION</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Palvision plays a crucial role in the Enabel project by empowering SMEs and cooperatives through business development, financial support, and sustainability-focused interventions. Palvison provides technical capacity-building for 51 businesses in Tubas ,North of the Jordan valley , Jericho and Jerusalem , focusing on green transition, resource efficiency, and digital transformation. It facilitates a grant/co-investment scheme supporting 30 SMEs and 4 cooperatives, ensuring sustainability milestones are met. Palvison also develops business frameworks integrating climate-smart agriculture and circular economy practices, while promoting market access through trade fairs and networking events. Additionally, it supports waste management and recycling initiatives, encouraging businessesto adopt zero-waste strategies. Through policy engagement with the Ministry of Agriculture and Economy, Palvision advocates for climate-resilient business practices and financial incentives for green enterprises, reinforcing sustainability in Palestine&#x2019;s agri-food sector.</narrative>
  </description>
